<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar — 100 no-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">make.fun · token-radar-01 · $1,325 · top 10 share the pot</div>
    <h1>Token Launch Radar</h1>
    <p class="sub">100 protocols with no token yet, ranked by implied circulating market cap —
      TVL × the market's own mcap/TVL multiple for their category. The next launches, watched.</p>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge" id="badge-asof">Snapshot 2026-11-14</span>
      <span class="badge warn">12 days stale at build — not live data</span>
      <span class="badge">40 watchlist · 60 below the $50M floor</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stats" id="stats"></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <section class="filters" aria-label="Filters">
    <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search name or slug…" autocomplete="off">
    <select id="cat" aria-label="Filter by category"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
    <select id="chain" aria-label="Filter by chain"><option value="">All chains</option></select>
    <label class="toggle"><input id="watchonly" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only</label>
    <span class="count" id="count"></span>
  </section>

  <section class="board">
    <table id="board">
      <thead><tr>
        <th class="num">#</th><th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th>Chains</th>
        <th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">7d</th>
        <th class="num">Implied mcap</th><th class="num">Score</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No protocol matches these filters.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="detail" id="detail" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="hint">Click any row to open its detail — full fields, implied-value range and farm plan.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="method">
    <h2>How the ranking works</h2>
    <p><strong>Implied value = TVL × category multiple.</strong> The multiple is the median
    mcap/TVL of token-bearing protocols in the same category (128 comparables with a positive
    circulating mcap). Categories with fewer than 5 comparables use the fallback multiple
    <strong>0.082</strong> — the median of the 52 comparables with TVL ≥ $50M. The score then
    adjusts for 7-day TVL momentum (clamped −50%…+100%) and chain breadth (up to +20% for 10+
    chains). Implied value is a <strong>circulating market cap, never FDV</strong> — the snapshot
    has no supply data.</p>
    <p><strong>What the board is:</strong> the 40-protocol watchlist taken verbatim from the
    snapshot (it cannot be recomputed — 20 child products are excluded only via data not in the
    file), plus the next 60 no-token protocols below the $50M floor by TVL. A protocol being
    here is <strong>not</strong> a claim it will launch a token — the snapshot contains no launch
    signal at all. Several rows are vault/curator businesses, stablecoins, chains or networks
    that may never issue a token.</p>
    <p><strong>Farm plans</strong> are category-generic (chains + action family + age/TVL/momentum
    context). <strong>Points status is unverified for every row</strong> — the snapshot never says
    whether a protocol has a points program. The board carries no outbound links: the snapshot
    has no URLs, so no protocol is linked out.</p>
    <p class="src">Source: DefiLlama sealed snapshot, fetched 2026-11-14T01:18:33Z.
    758 protocols in file; median 7d change −8.23% — a down week, so a negative 7d is the market,
    not the protocol. Built offline from the sealed snapshot; no live prices.</p>
  </section>
</main>

